{"title":"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A large square is divided into nine identical smaller squares. Five of the smaller squares are shaded, as shown.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If the total area of the shaded squares is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c99ef5417f64a90d60f6162563579eb88a6500ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\text { m}^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"17\" />, what is the area, in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e134066861513d827b5750f9e4e6a7a47bfcfee7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{m}^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" />, of the large square?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> shaded squares and the total area of them is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df6462505b8e359e9e05249313a588bdba24867a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\text{ m}^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"17\" />, the area of one shaded square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/6/9560ad13fbc43352e2d9865a1a3428c37fb73f25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20 \\text { m}^{2}}{5} = 4 \\text { m}^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> identical squares in total, so the full area of the large square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81f405adad8e2ef2413d40b06c09b6af3e78fcb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\text{ m}^{2} \\times 9 = \\boxed{36 \\text { m}^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"150\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC\">2024 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?